title: "Monotone Evidence Sharing for Rate Adaptation in IEEE 802.11be — artifact"
abstract: >-
  ns-3 rate-adaptation manager that propagates each transmission outcome to
  neighbouring rates ordered by required SNR rather than by data rate, with the
  campaign data and the scripts that regenerate every table and figure in the paper.
